# Absence detection (#79): run the sweeper every five minutes.
# INERT EXAMPLE. Nothing installs this file. Activation is the owner's decision
# and needs consumer registrations and collector observations to be useful.
# Install by hand with `crontab -e` only after that decision. MC_URL and
# MC_TOKEN must come from the host's own secret store, not from this file.
#
# */5 * * * * /path/to/agent-kontrol/scripts/sweep-once.sh >>"$HOME/Library/Logs/agent-kontrol-sweep.log" 2>&1
